%% FINAL v2: life of one score_files row. "processing" is protected by a time-limited lease.
%% visibility is separate from status: every stored file is private until a recorded rights review (future website stage).

stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> pending: import records the file
    pending --> processing: claimFiles sets a lease
    processing --> stored: verified and uploaded
    processing --> rejected: licence policy says no
    processing --> pending: temporary error, retry after backoff
    processing --> failed: permanent error or max attempts
    failed --> pending: owner resets it
    stored --> withdrawn: takedown or rights problem
    stored --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
    withdrawn --> [*]
    note left of processing
        Protected by a lease. If the worker crashes,
        the lease expires and the next run claims it again.
    end note
    note right of stored
        visibility = private by default.
        public only after a rights review.
    end note
